# Hero demo source assets: the raw final.mp4 and full-resolution keyframe
# PNGs are real, produced output (not fabricated), but too large to carry
# in git history indefinitely — see examples/hero_demo/README.md for how
# they get distributed instead (GitHub release/asset hosting at launch,
# not a committed blob). The compact preview.gif and the small JSON
# artifacts (storyboard.json, script.json) ARE committed — they're the
# actual point of an "example" and are small.
examples/hero_demo/final.mp4
examples/hero_demo/keyframes/

